<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Day by day His grace grows dearer; His love has conquered me,</l><l>Never leaving, never ceasing, His Spirit constantly</l><l>Flooding me, rich and free;</l><l>Higher than the highest heaven, He lifts me up to see</l><l>New Jerusalem descending, His Bride, His love to be</l><l>Eternally, it shall be.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
